\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {31}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Maze world-model rows: CMAZE-O (observation generation), TEST, Config C-field, 3 seeds (one pre-registered scored run per seed). The rival margin is WITHDRAWN; the store gate holds.} Generate the grid state for a request of colours, object cells and layout; exact placement and legality. Store and head are fitted in the observation field ($K=8$, 64 atoms) and read out by a parameterless decode, with no autoencoder in the read path; every rival regresses the identical field at matched read floats. The rival rows here use the recipe's 3,000 training steps, the budget whose margin is withdrawn. Byte convention as Table~\ref {tab:cmazet}. Values are mean (seed 0 / 1 / 2). This table contains no CMAZE-T, CMAZE-1, CMAZE-2 or CMAZE-2b row.}}{41}{table.31}\protected@file@percent }
