\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Deletion of colour 1 (value scope), seed 0, words plus observation.} On the surviving-colour TEST $n$-way rows that the deletion rows score, the first per rule family: $s_t$ with the action, the engine's $s_{t+1}$, the store before deletion, after the downdate and fitted without the deleted rows (the downdated and the fitted-without store emit the same outcome on every surviving row, every seed), and the matched MLP as trained and retrained without. For the arms of Table~\ref {tab:cmazet}: {\color  {red}\textbf  {[PLACEHOLDER:}~w16 CMAZE-T post-deletion per-arm generated $s_{t+1}$ (store before / after downdate, each rival as trained / retrained without): not buildable from persisted artefacts; may remain undrawn, and if drawn may show the downdated store failing where a retrained rival succeeds\textbf  {]}}}}{48}{figure.17}\protected@file@percent }
